+An explicit Universal checkout must already be at the revision pinned by the script. Before a
+Universal cell is timed, the C++ adapter checks all 16 operation results against fixed-width
+binary vectors generated by FloatLean. Unsupported or disagreeing cells are recorded and omitted
+from the timing plot.
